<section class="hero">
  <span class="label">An AI journal</span>
  <h1>Write it down. <em>Great minds write back.</em></h1>
  <p>Tell Letterlight about your day. Seneca, Tolstoy, Rumi or Maimonides answers with a personal letter, and ends it with one question to carry into tomorrow.</p>
  <div class="cta">
    <span class="badge">Coming soon to Google Play</span>
