<section class="block" aria-labelledby="more">
  <h2 id="more">More than a reply</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div><h3>Small practices</h3><p>Mentors can set you a short exercise drawn from CBT and remind you at the time you choose.</p></div>
    <div><h3>A daily routine</h3><p>A walk, a meal, a short meditation. Your mentor reminds you, in their own voice.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Your own sources</h3><p>Attach text, a web page, a PDF or a photo to an entry, and your mentor reads it before writing back.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Kept on your phone</h3><p>Your journal is stored on your device, and there's no account to create. <a href="/privacy.html">How your data is handled</a></p></div>
    <div><h3>A writing streak</h3><p>See how many days in a row you've written.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

